    "detailed_description": "<br>Archmage Ricka is a series RPG developed by Alecubicsoft,  published by OTAKU Plan. Archmage Ricka contains The Small Fry Dungeon and the Archmage, The Thief in the dungeon and the Archmage.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY</h2><strong>The Small Fry Dungeon and the Archmage</strong><br>In order to retrieve the illegal property embezzled by the evil Lord, Ricka received a mission to capture the Lord.<br>But it was a trap. She fell into a dungeon arranged by the Lord in advance.<br>Although the demons in the dungeon are weak, the existence of various traps makes it difficult to escape!<br><br><strong>The Thief in the dungeon and the Archmage</strong><br>The band of thieves ran into the dungeon!<br>It's an underground dungeon full of traps and monsters and the soldiers can't get in there.<br>Finally, bounties were put on the head of the thieves. But despite the perilous mission of going through the dungeon, the reward was little and no one dared to do it.<br>... All except Ricka the archmage.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Cute graphic<br></li><li>3D dungeon<br></li><li>Auto battle[/list*]</li></ul>",
